{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106129","id":2502324439,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6VJnDX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106129","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106129.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106129.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106129","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106129/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106129/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106129/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6d56d2d05e3bb30081d701b41ef2284678612ed6","number":106129,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix tests that fail when alone","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- related #88452\r\n\r\nCertain tests fail when by themselves, since they depend on other tests.\r\nUse these args to test:\r\n`--test --tc=\"[ProjectSettings]*\"`, `--test --tc=\"[Modules][GDScript] Load source code dynamically and run it\"`\r\n\r\nI tested on release build and this seems to fix the issues from #88452 for these 3 tests, the other one still has an issue in non-editor builds.\r\n\r\nFor `[ProjectSettings] Get existing setting` and `[ProjectSettings] Default value is ignored if setting exists`, they expect to be ran after the `[Modules][GDScript]` `Script compilation and runtime` test, which modifies the ProjectSettings.\r\nI changed them to use a different project setting that was untouched by that test.\r\n\r\nFor `[Modules][GDScript] Load source code dynamically and run it`, the GDScript fails during compilation with an error `Compile Error: GDScript bug (please report): Native class \"RefCounted\" not found.`.\r\nThis is because the language wasn't initialized for this test.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saue